# Two Deconstruction Hammers on the Ornithopter give it two instances of "{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Deconstruction Hammer:
# Destroy target artifact or enchantment" (CR 113.2c). In each, "Deconstruction Hammer" means the Hammer that gave it (CR
# 201.5a), so activating one sacrifices that Hammer with no choice of which to sacrifice; the other stays attached, and the
# Ornithopter is a 1/3 with one instance left.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Sol Ring
Ornithopter
Deconstruction Hammer
Deconstruction Hammer
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Island x20

